Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Source: OCR of hardcoded English subs ([1029-1030] Onigashima 37 - The Tower.mp4); opening lyrics omitted}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.28,0:01:24.08,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Subtitles by HatSubs
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.58,0:01:25.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.79,0:01:28.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stay focused!\NBehind you!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.96,0:01:31.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ya little runt!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.30,0:01:39.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ouch.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.40,0:01:51.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whaaaa?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.90,0:01:54.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Queen-sama's blade\Njust snapped right off!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.82,0:01:57.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He definitely hit him\Nin the neck, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.82,0:02:02.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How did he break that sword with his neck?\NYou're amazing, Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.74,0:02:06.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Armament Haki!\NWhatever it was, that's impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.41,0:02:10.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You didn't use Haki, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.42,0:02:13.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Germa's got some\Nserious scientific muscle, don't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.09,0:02:18.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's the deal with this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.77,0:02:30.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Your body's fascinating!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.69,0:02:33.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I remember what Judge once said\Nlike it was yesterday:
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.86,0:02:40.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"Give humans exoskeletons!"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.20,0:02:43.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"Give them extraordinary\Nhealing abilities!"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.29,0:02:48.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"Give them physical strength!"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.12,0:02:55.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"And give them,\Nunfeeling hearts of ice!"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.42,0:02:57.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm so very sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.80,0:03:00.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I've served you something\Nthat did not suit your taste, Niji-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.23,0:03:12.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tryin' to leave a mark\Non a lady's face, huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.19,0:03:16.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.73,0:03:21.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...don't want to become\None of those heartless monsters!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.91,0:03:24.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But you are a monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.78,0:03:28.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Welcome to this monster world!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.79,0:03:32.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Black Light Roast!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.62,0:03:32.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Black Light Roast!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.04,0:03:34.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Black Light Roast!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.80,0:03:39.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute, dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.97,0:03:45.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What the hell's\Nhappening to my body?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.27,0:03:51.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I need some time to process this!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.56,0:03:55.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Think back!\NWhat've I done up 'til now?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.86,0:04:01.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who the hell are you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.53,0:04:06.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sangoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.95,0:04:09.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is it because\NI transformed into Soba Mask?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.45,0:04:11.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.00,0:04:15.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Am I seriously losing who I am?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.09,0:04:18.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sanji's...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.84,0:04:20.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...been acting real funny...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.96,0:04:23.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's one of the Straw Hats!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.84,0:04:26.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Queen-san's got him cornered!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.34,0:04:28.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's mumbling something...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.26,0:04:30.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This's our chance!\NShoot to kill!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.14,0:04:37.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're done,\NBlack-Leg Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.07,0:04:42.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah!\NGot him!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.78,0:04:43.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ya-hoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.25,0:04:54.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That hurt, ya know!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.33,0:04:56.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whaaaa?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.21,0:05:04.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's one tooough exoskeleton!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.01,0:05:10.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Put on your combat suit!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.56,0:05:13.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Show me more\Nof Germa's science!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.56,0:05:17.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I got nothin' to do with those bastards!\NDon't lump me in with them!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.82,0:05:23.82,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(370,362)}Cave\NChamber
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.24,0:05:27.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm betting you're a Navy spy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.41,0:05:31.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But in this case,\Nit doesn't matter...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.41,0:05:35.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The real question is,\Ndo you or don't you wanna take down Kaido?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.71,0:05:39.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,When this battle is over,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.79,0:05:42.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,the winners're gonna be\Non their last legs!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.63,0:05:46.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Won't be hard to finish 'em off then!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.59,0:05:48.30,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(150,594)}Zanki
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.34,0:05:50.85,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(1670,594)}Fuga
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.64,0:05:52.56,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(1670,594)}Inbi
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.18,0:05:57.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whaddya think?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.52,0:06:02.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wanna pal around with us and take everything\Nfor ourselves after all's said and done?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.23,0:06:05.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaido's army, the rebel army...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.78,0:06:11.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Since we're part of neither side,\Nwe don't got reason to be at each other's throats!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.24,0:06:14.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm amazed...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.87,0:06:17.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You really think\NI'd trust a coward like you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.79,0:06:21.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're hardly to be trusted yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.00,0:06:24.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm telling you this because\NI think there's benefits in it for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.96,0:06:26.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're not gonna get...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.38,0:06:30.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,another opportunity like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.15,0:06:42.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why do you laugh!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.90,0:06:47.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I took you for the sort\Nthat doesn't laugh much...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.36,0:06:55.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You didn't...\NYou ate a Smile Fruit, didn't you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.67,0:07:10.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You have the greatest\Nmisfortune, Killer!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.47,0:07:12.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.47,0:07:13.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Killer-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.51,0:07:15.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.56,0:07:17.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Basil Hawkins!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.68,0:07:19.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaido's stinkin' lapdog!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.89,0:07:22.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How could you betray us?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.27,0:07:25.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Please...!\NDon't!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.32,0:07:31.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lay a hand on him\Nand I'll make sure you regret it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.24,0:07:35.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Killer-san, why won't you\Nlet us help out?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.79,0:07:44.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Your captain is my hostage.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.13,0:07:49.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It appears he's fighting\NBig Mom now...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.01,0:07:52.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A losing prospect for him,\Nif you ask me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.97,0:07:58.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,As it is, there are few fates\Nthat remain available to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.15,0:08:05.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Killer-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.73,0:08:08.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So frustrating!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.36,0:08:13.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The fire's closing in, too!\NWe gotta get outta here, and fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.49,0:08:16.49,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(1116,149)}Castle Interior\NStairway linking\N1st and 2nd Floors
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.45,0:08:20.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.70,0:08:23.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We rescued Komachiyo!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.30,0:08:34.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hurry, or the fire's\Ngonna swallow us!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.31,0:08:45.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's a monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.65,0:08:48.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A monster of the lower half variety!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.73,0:08:51.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Somebody, lend me aid poo!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.44,0:08:53.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Uh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.24,0:08:54.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huuuuh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.82,0:08:58.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Someone, anyone poooo!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.24,0:09:01.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait, wait!\NWhat the heck are you doing!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.20,0:09:04.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I require assistance-poo!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.21,0:09:07.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's why I need you to wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.75,0:09:10.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who goes there-poo?!\NI be Kin'emon-poo!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.00,0:09:13.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Calm down!\NJust calm down!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.17,0:09:16.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He ain't a monster, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.18,0:09:19.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A human?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.39,0:09:23.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I seek my allies-poo!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.14,0:09:26.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And I'm one of them,\NKin'emon!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.06,0:09:28.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's me!\NUsopp!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.31,0:09:30.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Unhand me-poo!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.44,0:09:34.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There is no time to poose!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.65,0:09:36.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whoa, talk about blood loss!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.57,0:09:39.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.41,0:09:42.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Usopp, he can't hear us!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.37,0:09:44.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,His ears are on his other half!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.29,0:09:45.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.54,0:09:48.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But we gotta let him know\Nit's us, somehow!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.00,0:09:51.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who goes there?!\NIdentify yourselves poo!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.29,0:09:54.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How is he talking?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.01,0:09:55.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,His farts.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.01,0:09:57.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Guess that's one of\NKin'emon's specialties.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.01,0:09:57.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.76,0:09:58.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Farts?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.55,0:10:01.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What an amazing skill!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.09,0:10:02.60,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(965,90)}What do we do now? Hmm...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.77,0:10:06.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Worth a shot...\NBoop!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.06,0:10:17.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Was that the reverse crescent moon?!\NThen you be an ally of mine-poo!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.07,0:10:17.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.74,0:10:19.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.11,0:10:21.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Then, I've a request\Nto ask of poo...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.62,0:10:26.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,One of my companions yet breathes,\Nhowever faint...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.29,0:10:30.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Please, do whatever\Nyou can to aid her!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.59,0:10:43.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're borrowing Hamlet!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.51,0:10:44.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You guys take care of Tama!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.85,0:10:55.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My goodness!\NEverybody needs me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.07,0:10:57.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thank poo!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.07,0:10:59.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I know not who you be,\Nbut you be an ally of mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.70,0:11:04.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,In the left tower on the castle's first floor\Nlies an entrance to a crawl space!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.49,0:11:06.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Leave it to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.42,0:11:20.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What the hell's up\Nwith this pain?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.43,0:11:25.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's wrong with you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.77,0:11:31.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's your deal?\NGot a migraine...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.69,0:11:34.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...Kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.02,0:11:35.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.06,0:11:36.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Hera!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.40,0:11:38.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes, Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.82,0:11:39.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Napoleon!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.90,0:11:41.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes, Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.28,0:11:44.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If it's hurting that bad,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.07,0:11:48.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,how about I relieve your head\Nfrom your shoulders!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.16,0:11:49.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Combine!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.25,0:11:53.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thank me later!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.42,0:11:57.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What is your problem!\NYou're useless, you know that!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.67,0:11:59.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're in my way, you quack!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.05,0:12:02.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Chambres!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.72,0:12:05.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Counter Shock!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.39,0:12:09.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.39,0:12:11.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You'll pay for that!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.14,0:12:14.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stolen Feuer!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.62,0:12:36.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mama-Raid!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.18,0:12:51.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A ballsy idiot's head,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.10,0:12:53.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,or a quack's arm...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.10,0:12:55.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Which one do I take first?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.03,0:13:03.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dammit all to hell...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.86,0:13:06.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm finally going toe-to-toe\Nwith an Empress of the Sea!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.36,0:13:09.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,if I die here, what was...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.91,0:13:12.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...the point of living\Nthe pirate life?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.50,0:13:23.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You crack me up,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.26,0:13:24.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kid!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.81,0:13:32.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eustasser!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.10,0:13:35.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You look like you could keel over\Nwithout my help!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.29,0:13:57.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.16,0:13:59.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stop it, Hawkins!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.50,0:14:02.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're pathetic, Killer.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.71,0:14:03.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.47,0:14:14.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This sucks...!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.27,0:14:17.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What the hell is\Ngoing on with me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.98,0:14:20.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let Kid go!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.03,0:14:30.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,In return...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.07,0:14:34.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...you can have...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.12,0:14:35.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...my life!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.96,0:14:42.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Killer-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.63,0:14:48.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Once Kid is no more,\Nlife will be easier for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.13,0:14:53.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The extent of your misery\Ncan be traced back to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.43,0:14:58.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You don't get it, do you,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.27,0:15:00.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hawkins
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.48,0:15:03.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kid's gonna put\Nthe Four Emperors to shame...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.15,0:15:05.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...and become the Pirate King!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.49,0:15:12.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stop it already!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.79,0:15:20.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hunt down the Four Emperors!\NBe the Pirate King?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.83,0:15:23.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How admirable,\Nhaving such grand ambitions!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.42,0:15:29.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't get in our way, then!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.59,0:15:34.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If I'm in your way,\Nthen cut me down with your scythes!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.72,0:15:41.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Or you can surrender,\Nmakes no difference to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.39,0:15:44.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll even put in a word\Nfor you with Kaido-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.15,0:15:51.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you asking me to work for Kaido?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.28,0:15:55.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's low, even for you...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.25,0:16:01.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Silence!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.29,0:16:05.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,At any rate, this is a battle\Nyou and your ilk cannot win!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.58,0:16:07.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You've seen how\Nharsh reality is, aye?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.25,0:16:12.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now you know the reasons\Nbehind their lengthy rule of these seas!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.13,0:16:15.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I know your animal instincts\Nare telling you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.72,0:16:17.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"There's no way I can win!"
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.68,0:16:22.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Go ahead, keep barkin'...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.52,0:16:25.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're regretting it, ain't ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.86,0:16:29.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The choice you made back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.82,0:16:36.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come work for me,\Nand you'll get a warm welcome...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.32,0:16:38.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Turn me down, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.08,0:16:45.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Regretting it 'cause you were scared\Nof dying in this future,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.25,0:16:48.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but here we are, still kicking!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.59,0:16:55.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You will soon know which of us\Nregrets their decision!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.22,0:16:56.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sure, buddy...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.55,0:17:00.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Then I think...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.47,0:17:03.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll just live without regrets!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.39,0:17:04.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sink or swim!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.16,0:17:18.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're just wearing\Nyourself out!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.62,0:17:24.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,See you in hell\Nyou worthless cub!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.29,0:17:31.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Two questions for you:
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.18,0:17:41.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What happens if you take damage...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.56,0:17:43.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but it's got nowhere to go?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.27,0:17:46.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What are you on about?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.19,0:17:49.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You know how my powers work!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.35,0:17:52.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kid receives all damage I take...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.53,0:17:58.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...as long as his straw doll\Nis stored within my body!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.32,0:18:00.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That so?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.77,0:18:29.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why?!\NYou severed my arm!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.52,0:18:31.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But all damage must...!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.40,0:18:33.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kid...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.90,0:18:36.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...has no left arm!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.20,0:18:45.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Drat!\NI did not foresee this!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.33,0:18:50.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So, question number two...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.67,0:18:58.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If I take this away,\Nhow many more lives do you have left?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.44,0:19:13.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Congratulations!\NThat's the last one.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.02,0:19:18.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The pain's... gone,\Njust like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.32,0:19:24.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Straw Man's Cards!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.45,0:19:28.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Death, Upright.\NThe card of destruction!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.81,0:19:56.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Guillotine Claws!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.90,0:20:00.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Strawman's been...!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.12,0:20:08.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Strawman won't die!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.74,0:20:11.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If it is in the cards,\Nit will return!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.21,0:20:13.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Reveal to us the outcome\Nof this battle!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.42,0:20:21.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Tower!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.35,0:20:28.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Spin Sonic!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.99,0:20:49.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Way to go!\NKiller-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.96,0:21:02.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hawkins-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.26,0:21:06.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Straw Man's Cards:\NThe Tower...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.64,0:21:16.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It represents...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.94,0:21:23.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"The collapse of the old"...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.45,0:21:30.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's this, now!\NAll better now, are we...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.70,0:21:32.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.12,0:21:36.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah...\NFeels like a load off my shoulders.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.63,0:21:41.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Its hidden meaning?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.42,0:21:44.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"A new path."
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.35,0:21:59.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Get goin', partner!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.74,0:22:14.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A bit longer...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.37,0:22:15.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Endure for just a little bit longer...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.95,0:22:17.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kiku!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.79,0:22:20.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I have just made contact\Nwith our allies...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.50,0:22:22.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Still...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.42,0:22:27.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I could scarcely believe that I was still alive\Neven after being cleaved in twain!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.88,0:22:33.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I suppose when Law-dono cut my body in half,\Nit was never properly reattached...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.97,0:22:35.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A miracle!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.52,0:22:37.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now if only...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.60,0:22:42.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If only Kiku can be...\Nsaved... somehow...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.07,0:22:47.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.49,0:22:52.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.28,0:22:56.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Answer me, Kanjuro!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.62,0:23:01.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey!\NCan you hear me, Kanjuro?!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.75,0:23:03.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It cannot be!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.04,0:23:05.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why do I hear Orochi's voice?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.55,0:23:09.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I am certain I beheaded him,\Nwith my own hands!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.09,0:23:14.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And Kanjuro is already...!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.68,0:23:17.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Kanjuro!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.89,0:23:23.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes, Orochi-sama...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.69,0:23:28.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Barely breathing,\NI see, Kanjuro...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.32,0:23:35.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I... I must say that this is...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.03,0:23:38.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...the end of my performance...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.25,0:23:41.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aye!\NMy hat's off to you, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.71,0:23:44.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,An outstanding performance, it was!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.13,0:23:51.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I appreciate your kind words\Nmore than anything...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.55,0:23:54.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kanjuro, do you hear them?!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.85,0:23:58.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The cheers for you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.52,0:24:03.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,F-For me!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.70,0:24:23.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yet I remain frustrated.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.92,0:24:26.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Resentful!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.96,0:24:28.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.13,0:24:30.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Our ancestors...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.09,0:24:33.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...await...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.76,0:24:37.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...a spectacular encore!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.47,0:24:40.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Paint it for me, Kanjuro!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.97,0:24:44.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Kurozumi Clan's\Nburning grudge!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.44,0:24:50.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who shall be the winner?!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.96,0:25:09.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The deep-seated wrath of\Nthe Kurozumi Clan...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.42,0:25:12.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...shall parade through this castle,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.13,0:25:13.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and at last!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.80,0:25:17.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It shall...\Nit shall walk unto the abyss,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.59,0:25:23.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and the nadir where it reaches an impasse\Nshall serve as our graveyard!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.64,0:25:27.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bring solace to our spirits,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.35,0:25:30.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kanjuro!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.44,0:25:31.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,As you wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.50,0:25:46.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I shall display for you...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.67,0:25:49.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...Kurozumi Kanjuro's\Nfinal performance!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.42,0:25:54.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kurozumi Mass Suicide:\NSwift Finale!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.26,0:25:57.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kazenbo!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.47,0:26:06.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're gonna burn alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.27,0:26:08.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,M... Monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.41,0:26:24.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Reporting in!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.54,0:26:29.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A giant spectre of unknown origin has appeared\Non the second floor of the castle interior!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.17,0:26:36.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The specter is passing through the walls\Nlike some kind of ghost!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.10,0:26:48.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The castle has turned\Ninto an inferno!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.07,0:27:02.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's time, time, time,\Ntime to show me...-
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.45,0:27:06.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...Germa's suuuu-it!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.33,0:27:08.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stupid freakin' lizard...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.08,0:27:10.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm sick of hearing you\Ntalk about that!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.68,0:27:28.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's it, then...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.14,0:27:30.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Time to go, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.14,0:27:32.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is no time for fighting!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.52,0:27:37.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're right...\NBefore the flames cut off our retreat!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.46,0:27:53.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Allies of the Kozuki...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.85,0:28:17.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Rulers of the sea...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.78,0:28:28.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pride goeth...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.29,0:28:31.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...before a fall!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.92,0:28:36.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Blast Breath!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.26,0:28:47.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gum-Gum...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.47,0:28:48.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gum-Gum...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.76,0:28:52.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...Red Hawk!
